{"id":10340,"slug":"10340-partial-trong-rails-views-la-gi-cach-dung-render-partial","category":"Rails","subcategory":"Controller & View","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Partial trong Rails Views là gì? Cách dùng `render` partial?","question_en":"What are partials in Rails Views? How do you render a partial?","answer_vi":"Partial là fragment ERB tái sử dụng — file tên bắt đầu bằng `_` (underscore).\n\n```erb\n<%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %>\n<article>\n  <h2><%= post.title %></h2>\n  <p><%= post.body %></p>\n</article>\n```\n\n```erb\n<%# app/views/posts/index.html.erb %>\n<%= render @posts %>          <%# Rails tự render _post.html.erb cho mỗi item %>\n<%= render partial: \"post\", locals: { post: @featured_post } %>\n```\n\nKhi truyền collection (`render @posts`), Rails tự lặp và dùng local variable khớp tên partial (`post` cho `_post.html.erb`) — không cần `.each` trong view.","answer_en":"A partial is a reusable ERB fragment — its filename starts with `_` (underscore).\n\n```erb\n<%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %>\n<article>\n  <h2><%= post.title %></h2>\n  <p><%= post.body %></p>\n</article>\n```\n\n```erb\n<%# app/views/posts/index.html.erb %>\n<%= render @posts %>          <%# Rails auto-renders _post.html.erb for each item %>\n<%= render partial: \"post\", locals: { post: @featured_post } %>\n```\n\nWhen passing a collection (`render @posts`), Rails iterates automatically and uses a local variable matching the partial name (`post` for `_post.html.erb`) — no `.each` needed in the view.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Partial là fragment ERB tái sử dụng — file tên bắt đầu bằng <code>_</code> (underscore).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %&gt;\n&lt;article&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;%= post.title %&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;&lt;%= post.body %&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>&lt;%= post.title %&gt;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>&lt;%= post.body %&gt;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# app/views/posts/index.html.erb %&gt;\n&lt;%= render @posts %&gt;          &lt;%# Rails tự render _post.html.erb cho mỗi item %&gt;\n&lt;%= render partial: &quot;post&quot;, locals: { post: @featured_post } %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># app/views/posts/index.html.erb %&gt;</span>\n&lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@posts</span> %&gt;          &lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Rails tự render _post.html.erb cho mỗi item %&gt;</span>\n&lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">partial:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;post&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">locals:</span> { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">post:</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@featured_post</span> } %&gt;</code></pre></div><p>Khi truyền collection (<code>render @posts</code>), Rails tự lặp và dùng local variable khớp tên partial (<code>post</code> cho <code>_post.html.erb</code>) — không cần <code>.each</code> trong view.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>A partial is a reusable ERB fragment — its filename starts with <code>_</code> (underscore).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %&gt;\n&lt;article&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;%= post.title %&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;&lt;%= post.body %&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/article&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%# app/views/posts/_post.html.erb %&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>&lt;%= post.title %&gt;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>&lt;%= post.body %&gt;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# app/views/posts/index.html.erb %&gt;\n&lt;%= render @posts %&gt;          &lt;%# Rails auto-renders _post.html.erb for each item %&gt;\n&lt;%= render partial: &quot;post&quot;, locals: { post: @featured_post } %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># app/views/posts/index.html.erb %&gt;</span>\n&lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@posts</span> %&gt;          &lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Rails auto-renders _post.html.erb for each item %&gt;</span>\n&lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">partial:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;post&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">locals:</span> { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">post:</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@featured_post</span> } %&gt;</code></pre></div><p>When passing a collection (<code>render @posts</code>), Rails iterates automatically and uses a local variable matching the partial name (<code>post</code> for <code>_post.html.erb</code>) — no <code>.each</code> needed in the view.</p>","references":[{"label":"Rails Guides — Layouts and Rendering (Partials)","url":"https://guides.rubyonrails.org/layouts_and_rendering.html#using-partials"},{"label":"Viblo — 53 câu hỏi phỏng vấn Ruby on Rails","url":"https://viblo.asia/p/53-cau-hoi-va-tra-loi-phong-van-ruby-on-rails-OeVKBW2rZkW"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/10341-flash-messages-trong-rails-la-gi-phan-biet-flash-va-flash-now","title":"Flash messages trong Rails là gì? Phân biệt `flash` và `flash.now`."},{"url":"/q/10342-csrf-protection-trong-rails-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"CSRF protection trong Rails hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10343-concern-trong-rails-la-gi-va-dung-trong-controller-model-the-nao","title":"Concern trong Rails là gì và dùng trong Controller/Model thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10300-ruby-on-rails-la-gi-triet-ly-thiet-ke-cot-loi-cua-framework-la-gi","title":"Ruby on Rails là gì? Triết lý thiết kế cốt lõi của framework là gì?"},{"url":"/q/10301-giai-thich-kien-truc-mvc-trong-rails","title":"Giải thích kiến trúc MVC tr